[ChapterMode "gamebook"]

3... Bc5 { If black plays Bc5, this opening is known as the Giuoco Piano, and you sadly can't play the fried liver attack! 😭
You have many good options to play here, such as the b4, the Evans Gambit, or c5, preparing for d4. However, the fried liver is not one of them. This opening is for another study. } *

