8... Kg8 { Incredibly, this is an even worse response from Black!
It's forced checkmate in 3 moves with Bxd5+ (Qxd5+ also works) Qxd5, Qxd5+ Be6, Qxe6#! Try it now! } 9. Bxd5+ (9. Qxd5+ { This move is fine, but lichess only lets you do 1 correct move. }) 9... Qxd5 10. Qxd5+ Be6 11. Qxe6# { And the game is over, just like that! Amazingly, Black actually plays Kg8 10% of the time, throwing the entire game away. } *

