8... Ke6! { This is the most common move for black, and for good reason. It protects the knight, and there's no checkmate in sight.
Let's add even more pressure to Black's knight with Nc3. } { [%cal Gb1c3,Re6d5] } 9. Nc3 { Great! We now have 3 pieces pointing at Black's knight. We'll probably win it. Black will probably do 1 of 2 moves, either Nb4 or Nd4. } { [%csl Gd5][%cal Gc3d5,Gf3d5,Gc4d5] } *

